{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "斜率 k 如何改变直线 y = kx",
    "goals": [
      "直观理解斜率 k 的正负与绝对值如何控制直线 y=kx 的倾斜方向与陡峭程度"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "运用单贯穿比喻'爬山坡'建立直观感受",
        "通过动态调节滑块观察 k 从正到零再到负的连续倾斜变化",
        "课后设置单数值验证练习巩固概念"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "斜率 k",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.03
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "请拖动滑块，把斜率 k 调整为 2。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "现在直线是下坡路，需要向右拖动滑块",
          "找到滑块上的正数 2 即可"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！准确调到了 2，这是一条比较陡的上坡路。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 2.01,
          "tolerance": 0.015
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过调节斜率 k 观察直线 y=kx 的倾角与陡峭变化，并完成目标斜率练习",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你好！我是豆豆，今天我们用一个很直观的比喻来看直线：把直线想成一段山路，我们人一律从左往右走。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -6,
                    "max": 6,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(x)",
                    "label": "y = kx"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(0)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = kx"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "现在滑块上的 k 是 1。从左往右看，山路向右上倾斜，每往右走 1 步，就往上升 1 格。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "如果把 k 调大到 3，山路一下子变陡了！向右走 1 步，要往上爬 3 格，正值越大，坡度就越陡峭。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 3,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "那要是把 k 慢慢减小到 0 呢？看，山路变成了一条完全水平的平地，既不向上也不向下。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 0,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "如果继续把 k 变成负数，比如减到 -2，山路就转向右下方倾斜了，变成了下坡路！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": -2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-06",
          "say": "总结一下规律：k 大于 0 是上坡，绝对值越大越陡；k 等于 0 是平路；k 小于 0 则是下坡。现在轮到你来试一试了：请把滑块调到 2，看看坡度会怎么变。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-06-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率 k 与直线特征",
                "items": [
                  "k > 0：向右上方倾斜（上坡），|k| 越大越陡",
                  "k = 0：水平直线（平路）",
                  "k < 0：向右下方倾斜（下坡）"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "斜率 k 决定直线 y=kx 的方向与陡峭程度：k 为正往右上爬，k 越大越陡；k 为 0 是一条平路；k 为负则是往右下走。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
